</span></a><nav class=\"ml-10 hidden items-center gap-7 md:flex\"><a class=\"font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors text-sol-cream hover:text-sol-cream/70 font-medium\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" href=\"/camere\">Camere</a><a class=\"font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors text-sol-cream hover:text-sol-cream/70 font-medium\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" href=\"/agricamping\">Agriglamping</a><a class=\"font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors text-sol-cream hover:text-sol-cream/70 font-medium\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" href=\"/esperienze\">Esperienze</a><a class=\"font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors text-sol-cream hover:text-sol-cream/70 font-medium\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" href=\"/prodotti\">Prodotti</a><a class=\"font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors text-sol-cream hover:text-sol-cream/70 font-medium\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" href=\"/chi-siamo\">Chi Siamo</a><a class=\"font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors text-sol-cream hover:text-sol-cream/70 font-medium\" style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)\" href=\"/contatti\">Contatti</a></nav><div class=\"ml-auto hidden md:block\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-none font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-sol-bark disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-60 bg-sol-terracotta text-white border border-sol-terracotta hover:bg-sol-terracotta/90 h-9 px-4\" variant=\"primary\" href=\"https://be.bookingexpert.it/book/simple/noavail?hotel=42837&amp;layout=14194&amp;lang=it&amp;currency=EUR\">Prenota Ora</a></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"ml-auto inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center md:hidden text-sol-cream\" aria-label=\"Apri menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Apri menu</span><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7H20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M4 12H20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M4 17H20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></div></header><main><main><section class=\"relative h-[70vh] min-h-[500px] overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Mobilhome luxury Agriglamping Relais del Sol\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-[rgba(92,74,50,0.7)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-12 left-6 md:left-16\"><span class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-olive\"><span class=\"text-sol-cream\">Glamping di lusso</span></span><h1 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-4xl font-light text-sol-cream md:text-6xl\">Agriglamping Relais del Sol</h1><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-lg font-sans text-base text-sol-cream/80\">Otto mobilhome luxury tra vigneti e oliveti, con il lago di Garda all&#x27;orizzonte.</p></div></section><section class=\"bg-sol-cream py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-16 px-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:px-16\"><div><span class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-olive\">L&#x27;esperienza</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-3xl font-light text-sol-bark md:text-4xl\">Non un campeggio. Un&#x27;altra idea di vacanza.</h2><p class=\"mt-6 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-sol-bark/70\">Svegliarsi con la veranda che guarda i vigneti. Fare colazione fuori, nell&#x27;aria del mattino, con il lago che si intuisce tra gli ulivi sullo sfondo. Le mobilhome di Relais del Sol non sono una sistemazione — sono un modo diverso di stare in vacanza.</p><p class=\"mt-4 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed text-sol-bark/70\">Ogni unità è stata pensata per chi vuole spazio, privacy e comfort senza rinunciare al contatto con la natura. Quaranta metri quadri di interno curato, una veranda di diciotto metri quadri, un giardino privato in erba. E i colori della campagna attorno.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-sol-mist p-5\"><p class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light text-sol-terracotta\">40mq</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/60\">Superficie interna</p></div><div class=\"bg-sol-mist p-5\"><p class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light text-sol-terracotta\">2</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/60\">Camere da letto</p></div><div class=\"bg-sol-mist p-5\"><p class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light text-sol-terracotta\">2</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/60\">Bagni</p></div><div class=\"bg-sol-mist p-5\"><p class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light text-sol-terracotta\">18mq</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/60\">Veranda privata</p></div><div class=\"bg-sol-mist p-5\"><p class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light text-sol-terracotta\">30mq</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/60\">Giardino privato</p></div><div class=\"bg-sol-mist p-5\"><p class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-light text-sol-terracotta\">150mq</p><p class=\"mt-1 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/60\">Parcheggio privato</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-sol-sand py-12\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-16\"><div class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-olive\">Ogni mobilhome include</span></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4\"><span class=\"bg-sol-cream px-5 py-3 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Soggiorno con divano</span><span class=\"bg-sol-cream px-5 py-3 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Cucina attrezzata</span><span class=\"bg-sol-cream px-5 py-3 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Due camere da letto</span><span class=\"bg-sol-cream px-5 py-3 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Due bagni</span><span class=\"bg-sol-cream px-5 py-3 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Veranda 18mq</span><span class=\"bg-sol-cream px-5 py-3 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Giardino privato</span><span class=\"bg-sol-cream px-5 py-3 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Parcheggio privato</span><span class=\"bg-sol-cream px-5 py-3 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">WiFi</span><span class=\"bg-sol-cream px-5 py-3 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Aria condizionata</span><span class=\"bg-sol-cream px-5 py-3 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Vista vigneti e oliveti</span><span class=\"bg-sol-cream px-5 py-3 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Vista lago</span><span class=\"bg-sol-cream px-5 py-3 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-sol-bark/70\">Barbecue (su richiesta, soggetto a disponibilità)</span></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-sol-cream py-12 md:py-16\"><div class=\"mb-8 text-center\"><span class=\"font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sol-olive\">Le mobilhome</span></div><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-2 gap-3 px-6 md:grid-cols-3 md:px-16 lg:grid-cols-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"relative aspect-[3/2] cursor-pointer overflow-hidden transition-opacity hover:opacity-90\"><img alt=\"Mobilhome luxury Agriglamping Relais del Sol\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagricamping%2Fagricamping-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"relative aspect-[3/2] cursor-pointer overflow-hidden transition-opacity hover:opacity-90\"><img alt=\"Mobilhome luxury Agriglamping Relais del Sol\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:ab